{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0643_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5ae4f84b7d1264d5caaa37cd49d00e65acc6499ab7fa46a8709fa88719c5f546", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌のタイアップ企画の撮影が終了。\n朋花の『スケルトン』は、とても様になってたな……）", "zh": "（写真杂志联动企划的拍摄结束了。\n朋花的“骷髅”看起来真是有模有样……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0643_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "06099a4499d33576a72134509e57006f9d8c1d255b71104ad777fff8b4d03cc0", "ja": "{$P$}さん～？\n撮影中、ずっと見とれていましたね～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生～？\n拍摄的时候，你一直都看得入迷了呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0643_1002_p", "source_sha256": "be7e900b0f0484e06af5d35a06896ef978fcc50dc11746380935d696e599ee46", "ja": "うっ……気づいてたか。\n言葉も出ないぐらい似合っていたから、つい。", "zh": "唔……被你发现了吗。\n因为实在太适合你，甚至让我说不出话来，所以不知不觉就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0643_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "ff0190116fbb7ded33fc6b0b5e6a02e792e13ee625227dfa4be9a6b012b892b5", "ja": "正直なのはいいことですね。\n私としては、これくらい当然のことですが～。", "zh": "坦率是件好事呢。对我来说，这点程度本来就是理所当然的～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0643_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3d857b59cef07166911a212c13c5d92119f660540e145bf42442e10f8a311e82", "ja": "まさか、朋花とスケルトンの相性がこんなにいいとは\n思わなくて。本物……いや、本物以上だったよ。", "zh": "没想到朋花和骷髅兵的契合度会这么高。\n简直像真的一样……不，甚至超越了真货呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0643_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "a289dd3cd0bfd252a035ee8055255d8f81b689c06b9ac02aaa78d4d46d509597", "ja": "少し複雑な気分ですが……ありがとうございます。\n事前に勉強した甲斐がありましたね～。", "zh": "虽然心情有些复杂……还是谢谢您。\n看来提前学习是有价值的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0643_1006_p", "source_sha256": "87a37a5d1b2f5debe0625722aa6723420838344b7f4ab8e033ec792f841f9a19", "ja": "勉強……スケルトンの？", "zh": "学习……是指骷髅的相关知识？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0643_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "1079771d955f27c2909cf05f1c5644958444a822661a34c3073e7b0328bea4db", "ja": "ええ、まあ。たとえば、『神聖な力に弱い』\nというのが、一般的なイメージのようですね。", "zh": "嗯，可以这么说。比如，“不擅长应对神圣力量”，似乎就是人们普遍的印象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0643_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "2e352d3ef7940edba2afd8f65cd38a0d6b33ad5308df80362763b6a1ee80fdf0", "ja": "聖母とは正反対の存在ですが……。だからこそ、\n表現できることがあるのではと考えたんです～。", "zh": "虽然是与圣母截然相反的存在……但正因为如此，我才觉得或许也能表现出一些特别的东西～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0643_1009_p", "source_sha256": "161de9e86be34e55aed248c11313d6303b69a6a9561cf8ac134c2ded63eddb32", "ja": "表現できること……。", "zh": "能够表现出来的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0643_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "2eb0f4a806fde7cae1f2d2b592183bcaf8f08efb60da494da23f524c9bfeabdd", "ja": "はい。視点を変えてみると、スケルトンは\n聖母が行きつく可能性のひとつなのかもしれない、と。", "zh": "是的。换个角度来看，骷髅或许是圣母最终走向的可能性之一……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0643_1011_p", "source_sha256": "16197b72d3b36fb0414991fde2f89eec54075a4f7bb7eb5837fa7e2a73f76a01", "ja": "可能性？　えっと……\nなんだか謎かけみたいになってきたな……。", "zh": "可能性？　那个……\n总觉得变得像在猜谜一样了啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0643_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "e325e9a2fe5f8ee4dac377aef371a502e0048ef0e7194c75ddd0ad08a3310f0b", "ja": "ふふ、難しく考えることはありません。スケルトンに\nなれば、永遠の時間を手に入れることができる。", "zh": "呵呵，没必要想得那么复杂。只要变成骷髅，就能获得永恒的时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0643_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "9e6d21f43884181861fc84df72b45354a9cef76568565c04386b0614678e6dd7", "ja": "それは時代や種族を超えて、あまねく子豚ちゃん達に\n聖母の慈愛を届けることができるということ……。", "zh": "那意味着无论跨越时代还是种族，都能将圣母的慈爱传递给所有的小猪仔……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0643_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9034603fd08092571cd42873d767f6316d63f1cfdf409c2b3aba281ea56ebf6d", "ja": "そ、壮大だな……。\nでも、今の話を聞いて納得したよ。", "zh": "好、好宏大啊……  \n不过，听你这么一说，我就明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0643_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0cd720163fbcefea0a78e3be284d30271bdc2b4278345e39476eed91e34120ec", "ja": "聖母としての覚悟が、さっきの撮影に詰まってたって。", "zh": "原来刚才的拍摄中，凝聚了你作为圣母的觉悟啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0643_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "ef6ae28e185eb10158a2ff81fb5dc839382b7db146085a763d35f80d0a6fc0b4", "ja": "{$P$}さん、気づくのが遅いですね。\nこれは……お仕置きが必要でしょうか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，您察觉到得太晚了。\n看来……需要给您一点惩罚了～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0643_1017_p", "source_sha256": "30def0ebfc6e7a315c7d583920cbc17c09c50485ba834e6a9e92ff53aac8f17b", "ja": "えっ！？　い、いや、すまない！　えっと……\n撮影を頑張ったご褒美で、挽回させていただければと。", "zh": "诶！？不、不是，对不起！那个……希望能用认真拍摄的奖励来弥补一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0643_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "df068b33ab243c9145f66cc6b1c6ceb3f5f7d11d8c7fd7381d729ad225fb031c", "ja": "贖罪のつもりですか？　……まあ、いいでしょう。\nどんなご褒美か、楽しみにしてますね～♪", "zh": "是想赎罪吗？……嗯，也好吧。究竟是什么奖励，我很期待呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
